menu "MHI controllers"

config QTI_MHI_QCOM
       tristate "MHI QCOM"
       depends on QTI_MHI_BUS && PCI
       help
	  If you say yes to this option, MHI bus support for Qualcomm Technologies, Inc modem chipsets
	  will be enabled.

config QTI_MHI_BUS_ARCH
       tristate "MHI BUS ARCH"
       depends on QTI_MHI_BUS && PCI
       help
          If you say yes to this option, MHI bus arch support for Qualcomm Technologies, Inc modem chipsets
          will be enabled.

endmenu
